# Lets the Hotspot menu item in journal.py bring up the access point without a
# password. Deliberately a separate file from 010_poweroff, so a mistake here
# cannot take away the ability to shut the device down.
#
# Check the nmcli path on the device first:
#
#     command -v nmcli
#
# and correct the line below if it is not /usr/bin/nmcli. sudo matches the full
# command, so only this exact invocation is permitted.

walker ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD: /usr/bin/nmcli connection up journal-ap
